Distance: 1500m Conditions: 9 MPH tailwind, occasional gusts of ~16 MPH. Light chop, more prevalent in the second 750. Comments: Alternated races with boys. Order of girls&#39; races: G3, G2, G1, G4/Novice. Berkshire finished about 1 foot ahead of Pomfret in the G3. Thank you, Berkshire and Middletown, for making the trip.
